        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwVsgBEy4J9dGTWCSkXYVhkojyYjN8fjDhticNqnizY5_0_g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "We’ve been using Lucy for yearly family photos for well over five years, and she is incredible. She’s warm, professional, amazing with kids and pets, and always makes us feel comfortable. Her location suggestions and styling tips are so helpful, and the photos are consistently stunning with fast turnaround. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1769783874,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Thomas carlton",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103339566551413792701/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCeE-lZjQrtxIovvYGLyyo-i_01LbT-EBNm1i3E4Njcoaf-nVY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "100% recommend\nWe are so happy we went with Lucy to be our wedding photographer.\nShe was a pleasure to work with.\n\nShe was organized, appropriately directive for our group shots and discrete when she needed to be.\n\nWe love how our pictures turned out.\n\nThanks so much Lucy!",
        "time": 1768963235,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kayleigh Beaveridge",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116218490938809678317/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLITgxc0mWBxUljSCWrO76CSg4cdXO4lvtJVDO-jn57tP0Dig=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We had an amazing experience with Lucy! She photographed our wedding and the photos turned out beautifully. She was able to capture the day perfectly.\n\nShe took the time to get to know us and our vision and made sure to capture that.\n\nI have recommended her to anyone I know needing a photographer and would definitely use her photographer services again in the future.",
        "time": 1768587540,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sara Del Fabbro",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100618012824990298834/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6VrW2XLR9Ol0v1auAeTJ6RPCzqLlenRRJUKdBac40S4opHA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We had the absolute pleasure of working with Lucy for our wedding, and we can’t recommend her highly enough! She is a true professional — calm, reassuring (especially when the weather wasn’t cooperating!), and incredibly talented. Her creative eye captured the day so beautifully, and she made us feel completely at ease throughout.\n\nWhat really sets Lucy apart is how much time she takes to understand your vision. She listens, collaborates, and works with you to ensure your day is captured exactly as you envisioned. Her care and attention to detail truly shine through in every photo.\n\nIf you’re looking for someone who’s not only skilled but also genuinely invested in your day, Lucy is the one. Highly, highly recommended!",
        "time": 1756830568,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Diana Pinnell",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103442362569978547316/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKZCDzNPhG8ZV8uli13Tq21qeh3UD7BplLJXeGAsc478FjB6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "in the last week",
        "text": "I cannot recommend Lucy highly enough! We first hired her for our wedding and have continued using her for our family photos throughout the years. We love her natural, authentic style, her photos feel genuine and timeless. She has an incredible ability to make us feel instantly comfortable and relaxed during shoots, and the results are always stunning. We consistently have such a hard time choosing our final photos because they all turn out beautifully! She's a joy to work with and we'll keep coming back.",
        "time": 1770817723,
        "translated": false
      }
